data: {"type":"text-start","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":"The"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":" data available here is a list of items with names and amounts —"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":" there are no accounts, balances, or spending categories in this environment. Without that"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":" underlying data, I can't build either the account balances page or the spending-by-category chart in a"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":" meaningful way.\n\nTo build what you're describing, I'd need:\n- **Account data** — account"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":" names and their current balances\n- **Transaction or spending data** — amounts broken down by category (e.g."}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":" groceries, travel, utilities)\n\nCould you let me know where that"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":" data lives — for example, is it in a connected service like a bank,"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":" accounting tool, or spreadsheet? Once I know the source, I can look into pulling"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79","delta":" it in."}

data: {"type":"text-end","id":"txt_2_169f3cb0-b77a-4775-a226-2d23bee85c79"}

data: [DONE]

